inology and Metabolism Service, Internal Medicine Department, Hadassah-Hebrew University Medical Center, Jerusalem, Israel. E-mail: <email>beng&#x00040;cc.huji.ac.il</email></p></fn><fn id="n1" fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding:</bold> The author is funded by grants from the Russell Berrie Foundation and D-Cure, Diabetes Care in Israel.</p></fn><fn id="n2" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests:</bold> The author has declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>